Design & Animation instructions:
- Template: Sobrio-profesional con toques coloridos. Use Title Font: Montserrat Bold (or Arial Bold if not available). Body Font: Calibri or Roboto.
- Color palette: Primary #2C6E6A; Secondary #FFD166; Neutral #F7F7F7; Accent #FF6B6B.
- Micro-animations: Appear/fade for bullets, subtle zoom for images, slide transitions 'Morph' if available. Keep animations short (<0.5s) and minimal.
- Layout: Keep text concise, large fonts (titles ≥32pt, bullets ≥20pt). Use icons for tech stack and screenshots for demo.

